sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant H as StalkerFusionRuntime (Host)
    participant C as StalkerController
    participant A as StalkerAttackController
    participant S as StalkerNetworkLifeStateConsequenceSink
    participant L as NetworkPlayerLifeState
    participant P as Fusion Clients

    Note over H,C: Host builds perception frame and advances AI
    H->>C: Simulate(authoritativeInput)
    C->>A: ResolveHitMoment(..., consequenceSink, step)
    Note over A,S: Sink implements IPlayerAttackConsequenceSink
    A->>A: Validate authority, episode, snapshot and range

    alt No authority / duplicate episode / invalid target
        A-->>C: No hit committed
    else Eligible episode at hit moment
        A->>A: Mark hit moment resolved (exactly once)
        A->>S: TryApplyStalkerHit(episodeId, playerId, position, time)
        S->>S: Validate Host, player identity and eligibility
        alt Target rejected / protected / hidden
            S-->>A: false
            A-->>C: ResolvedMiss
        else Eligible alive player
            S->>L: TryApplyMonsterDown(STALKER, position)
            alt Life-state change accepted
                L-->>S: true
                S-->>A: true
                A-->>C: ResolvedHit
                L-->>P: Replicated life state (Downed or Eliminated)
            else No life-state change
                L-->>S: false
                S-->>A: false
                A-->>C: ResolvedMiss
            end
        end
    end
